%% ============================================================================
%% Diagram 6 - Deployment flow
%% Purpose: full deployment from commit to verified release
%% ============================================================================
flowchart LR
    C[git commit] --> P[git push to main]
    P --> F[Fetch code in pipeline]
    F --> BT[Build + test]
    BT --> SC[Security scan<br/>npm audit + Trivy]
    SC -->|clean| IMG[Build Docker images]
    IMG --> ECR[Push to Amazon ECR]
    ECR --> SSM[Update SSM image params]
    SSM --> REF[Start ASG instance refresh]
    REF --> NEW[New instances pull new images]
    NEW --> HC[ALB health checks pass]
    HC -->|healthy| OK[Release ✓]
    HC -->|unhealthy| RB[Rollback: set SSM params to previous tag + refresh]
    RB --> NEW